  description: '(This card is always treated as an "Xyz" card.)

    When this card
    is activated: You can Special Summon 1 "Number 39: Utopia" from your GY, and
    if you do, it gains ATK equal to the total ATK of all LIGHT "Utopia" and "Utopic"
    Xyz Monsters in your GY. When your attacking "Utopia" or "Utopic" Xyz Monster
    whose original Attribute is LIGHT destroys an opponent''s monster by battle:
    You can make that monster you control lose 1000 ATK, and if you do, it can attack
    again in a row. You can only activate 1 "Endless Bond" per turn.'
